{"route":{"id":"17445","name":"Volta al terme de l'Escala","intro":"En aquest cas es tracta d’una ruta que encercla gran part del terme municipal de l’Escala. En aquest itinerari, a la banda litoral, recorrerem la costa <strong>resseguint el GR-92, </strong>caminarem per <strong>penya-segats</strong> i<strong> </strong>visitarem <strong>cales i dune</strong>s <strong>al Passeig d’Empúries.</strong> La part interior del recorregut transcorre entre antics <strong>camps de conreu</strong>, atractius <strong>masos fortificats</strong> i <strong>boscos de pins</strong> a la duna continental. A la part final de la ruta caminarem entre murs de pedra seca al <strong>camí dels Termes.</strong>","tipus":"Circular antihorari","dificultat":"Difícil","durada":"5 hores 12 minuts","desnivell":"133.00 meters","distancia":"18.20 km","tema":"Flora i fauna, Paisatgístic","imgs":["n17445_1.jpg","n17445_2.jpg","n17445_3.jpg","n17445_4.jpg"],"url":"https://naturalocal.net/ca/rutes-senderisme-catalunya/rutes-senderisme-girona/rutes-senderisme-parc-natural-del-montgri-illes-medes-i-baix-ter/volta-al-terme-de-lescala","track":[[42.10939,3.1677],[42.10952,3.16758],[42.10964,3.16787],[42.10973,3.16817],[42.10985,3.16843],[42.10994,3.16866],[42.11001,3.16888],[42.11017,3.1688],[42.11041,3.16863],[42.11064,3.16839],[42.11082,3.16823],[42.11099,3.16809],[42.11118,3.16793],[42.1114,3.16781],[42.1116,3.16774],[42.11178,3.16757],[42.11197,3.16746],[42.11218,3.1674],[42.1124,3.1673],[42.1126,3.16715],[42.1128,3.16713],[42.11303,3.16719],[42.11325,3.16724],[42.11314,3.16702],[42.11308,3.16675],[42.11301,3.16653],[42.11295,3.16628],[42.11287,3.16603],[42.11279,3.16579],[42.11268,3.16554],[42.1126,3.16526],[42.11255,3.16499],[42.11254,3.16471],[42.11265,3.16452],[42.11281,3.1643],[42.11302,3.16417],[42.11309,3.16386],[42.1132,3.16363],[42.11335,3.16341],[42.11349,3.16319],[42.11364,3.16295],[42.11377,3.16261],[42.11395,3.1624],[42.11413,3.16219],[42.11432,3.16198],[42.11446,3.16175],[42.11457,3.16157],